---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Enterprise Data Protection"
  description="Valtrix AI Privacy Policy. Learn about our strict data protection standards, zero telemetry in private mode, and enterprise data isolation."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <header class="section-hero" style="padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 2.5rem; text-align: left;">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span> Compliance &amp; Trust
      </div>
      <h1 class="title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--muted2); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px;">Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Valtrix AI</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">1. Commitment to Enterprise Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          At Valtrix AI, we engineer our software verification products around the principle of zero-trust data isolation. We recognize that application codebases, test fixtures, API schemas, and proprietary database architectures represent our customers' most sensitive intellectual property.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">2. Static Marketing Site Data Collection</h2>
        <p>
          This website (hosted as a static site on Render) does not use invasive third-party tracking pixels, biometric identifiers, or cross-site tracking cookies. When you voluntarily submit inquiries via our walkthrough request forms, the provided contact details are utilized solely for scheduling technical architecture reviews.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">3. Zero Application Telemetry in Private Deployments</h2>
        <p>
          For enterprise, on-premises, and self-hosted instances of Valtrix AI testing studios:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <li>No proprietary customer source code, requirements text, or test execution output is transmitted to public cloud LLMs unless explicitly configured by the customer.</li>
          <li>Local model options (via Ollama or internal enterprise gateways) keep 100% of reasoning on private hardware.</li>
          <li>Cryptographic audit trails and database inspection logs remain exclusively within the customer's owned infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">4. Data Retention &amp; Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may request deletion or review of any submitted contact information at any time by contacting our team directly at <a href="mailto:contact@valtrix.ai" style="color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: underline;">contact@valtrix.ai</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
